<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="card shadow-sm p-4" style="border-radius: 12px;">
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">How to Compress a PDF File Online</h2>

        <p>
            In today’s digital world, PDF files are widely used for sharing documents due to their portability and universal compatibility. However, large PDF files can slow down email delivery, consume unnecessary storage, or make uploading to websites cumbersome. 
            Our free online PDF compressor is designed to help you reduce PDF file size efficiently while maintaining high-quality content. Whether it’s for business reports, resumes, e-books, or presentations, our tool makes PDF compression simple and fast.
        </p>

        <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Step-by-Step Guide to Using Our PDF Compressor</h3>
        <p>
            Compressing a PDF file has never been easier. Follow these straightforward steps to shrink your PDFs in seconds:
        </p>
        <ol class="mb-4">
            <li>
