            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Click the “Compress PDF” button</strong> – Once your file is uploaded, hit the compress button to start the process. The compression engine will optimize images, fonts, and objects to reduce file size without losing clarity.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Download your compressed PDF</strong> – After a few seconds, your reduced PDF will be ready for download. You can instantly save it to your computer, smartphone, or cloud storage.
            </li>
        </ol>

        <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Key Features and Benefits of Using Our PDF Compressor</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>✔ <strong>100% free online PDF compression</strong> – No hidden charges, subscription fees, or trial limits.</li>
            <li>✔ <strong>No registration or installation required</strong> – Compress PDFs directly from your browser without downloading software.</li>
            <li>✔ <strong>Secure and private</strong> – Your files are processed with high-level encryption, and all uploads are deleted from our servers after compression.</li>
            <li>✔ <strong>Fast and efficient</strong> – Reduce large PDFs in seconds with minimal impact on quality.</li>
            <li>✔ <strong>Cross-platform compatibility</strong> – Works on Windows, Mac, Android, and iOS devices seamlessly.</li>
            <li>✔ <strong>Multiple file handling</strong> – Compress multiple PDFs at once without compromising speed.</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="mt-3">
            Using a PDF compressor is essential for anyone who deals with digital documents regularly. Large files can hinder workflow, cause email errors, and create storage challenges. By compressing PDFs, you streamline communication and optimize storage, making document management easier.
        </p>

        <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Common Use Cases for PDF Compression</h3>
        <p>
            Our PDF compression tool is versatile and caters to a variety of personal, academic, and professional needs:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Email Attachments:</strong> Many email servers have file size limits. Compressing PDFs ensures your files are under the limit and delivered without issues.</li>
            <li><strong>Website Uploads:</strong> Reduce file sizes for faster website loading times and improved SEO performance when uploading PDFs to blogs, portfolios, or online resources.</li>
            <li><strong>Job Applications:</strong> Submit resumes or portfolios that meet file size requirements while maintaining professional quality.</li>
            <li><strong>Document Sharing:</strong> Easily share PDFs via messaging apps, cloud storage, or file-sharing services without worrying about slow downloads.</li>
            <li><strong>Archiving:</strong> Store large PDF libraries efficiently, saving disk space and improving retrieval times.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Why Our PDF Compressor Stands Out</h3>
        <p>
            Unlike many PDF compression tools, our solution focuses on simplicity, speed, and security. You don’t need any technical expertise to reduce your PDF file size. Whether you’re a student, professional, or casual user, our online tool provides a hassle-free experience.
        </p>
        <p>
            Additionally, the compression process is optimized to preserve the readability of text, clarity of images, and formatting of tables and charts. This ensures that your compressed PDF looks professional and maintains the integrity of your original document.
        </p>

        <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Tips for Effective PDF Compression</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Check if your PDF contains high-resolution images; compressing images can significantly reduce the file size.</li>
            <li>Remove unnecessary elements such as unused fonts, annotations, or embedded media before compression.</li>
            <li>If you have multiple PDFs, try compressing them individually to ensure the best quality for each document.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h3>
        <p><strong>Q1: Is it safe to upload my PDF files to this tool?</strong></p>
        <p>
            Absolutely. All uploads are encrypted, processed securely, and automatically deleted from our servers after compression. Your privacy is our top priority.
        </p>

        <p><strong>Q2: Will compressing my PDF reduce its quality?</strong></p>
        <p>
            Our compressor is designed to maintain high-quality output while reducing file size. Text, images, and formatting remain intact in most cases. For documents requiring maximum fidelity, we recommend reviewing the compressed file before sharing.
        </p>

        <p><strong>Q3: Can I compress multiple PDFs at once?</strong></p>
        <p>
