        </p>

        <p><strong>Q4: What devices and browsers are compatible?</strong></p>
        <p>
            The PDF compressor works on all major operating systems including Windows, Mac, Android, and iOS. It is compatible with modern browsers like Chrome, Firefox, Safari, and Edge.
        </p>

        <p><strong>Q5: Do I need to download any software?</strong></p>
        <p>
            No. This is a fully online tool that requires no installation. Simply upload your PDF, compress it, and download the optimized version directly from your browser.
        </p>

        <p><strong>Q6: Are there file size limitations?</strong></p>
        <p>
            While our tool supports most standard PDF sizes, extremely large files may take longer to process. For very large PDFs, we recommend splitting the document into smaller sections before compression for faster results.
        </p>

        <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Conclusion</h3>
        <p>
            Reducing PDF file size has never been easier. Our free online PDF compressor is a reliable, secure, and fast solution for anyone looking to optimize documents without sacrificing quality. Whether it’s for personal use, business communication, or educational purposes, compressing PDFs helps save time, storage, and bandwidth. 
        </p>
        <p>
            Try our PDF compression tool today and experience seamless, high-quality file optimization. Say goodbye to oversized PDFs and enjoy faster sharing, easier storage, and better workflow efficiency.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
